{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09130","headline":"送洛阳韩丞东游 · 韦应物","name":"送洛阳韩丞东游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙鸟何飘颻，绿衣翠爲襟。\n顾我差池羽，咬咬怀好音。\n徘徊洛阳中，游戏清川浔。\n神交不在结，欢爱自中心。\n驾言忽徂征，云路邈且深。\n朝游尚同啄，夕息当异林。\n出饯宿东郊，列筵属城阴。\n举酒欲爲乐，忧怀方沈沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}